{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123839","id":4642228024,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFLLHOA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123839","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123839.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123839.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123839","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123839/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123839/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123839/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/21425d2c0c95ee53e7bf372db82b9b72458f6fae","number":123839,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix `String.to_float()` counting leading zeros toward the digit limit","user":{"login":"gjain-27","id":127025771,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5JCaw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127025771?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27","html_url":"https://github.com/gjain-27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gjain-27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123700\r\n\r\n`String.to_float()` was reading at most 18 digits which included leading zeros, causing numbers to be truncated.\r\n\r\nFor example: `\"00000000000000000001.5\"` was being parsed as 0.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe fix consists of:\r\n- Leading zeros are skipped, and if the integer part is zero, zeros that appear right after the decimal point are also skipped and counted. The count is used to adjust the exponent so the value stays correct.\r\n- Strings consisting of `\"0\"` or `\"0.000\"` are still treated as valid numbers.\r\n- Added tests to `[String] String to float`.\r\n\r\nIt passes the full test suite. Without the fix, the newly added test cases will fail.\r\n\r\nThe rounding error mentioned in the issue is out of scope for this PR.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak